I asked Lebanon’s President Joseph Aoun for his message for the Israeli government and the Israeli people: “Aren’t you fed up with war since 1948? Do you really want to live in peace? Let’s sit and talk. For the Israeli government, it’s time for the power of reason to prevail over the reason of power.”

